        "timestamp": "2026-10-09T00:40:16.883Z",
        "role": "assistant",
        "visibility": "user",
        "complete": true,
        "text": "A page that flags which bakery orders need attention \u2014 got it. Quick question before I build: today, how do you track orders (paper, a spreadsheet, something else), and what usually makes an order \"need attention\" for you \u2014 it's due soon, it hasn't been paid, it's a custom/special request, something else?\n\nI'll default to building a page with orders due today/tomorrow and unpaid orders flagged first, but tell me what matters most for your bakery and I'll build around that.",
